  "notes": "{腐食|ふしょく} refers to the chemical degradation of materials.\n\nKANJI BREAKDOWN:\n- {腐|ふ} (rot, decay, corrode)\n- {食|しょく} (eat, erode)\n\nTYPES OF CORROSION:\n- {電気|でんき}{腐食|ふしょく}/{電食|でんしょく} (electrolytic corrosion)\n- {化学|かがく}{腐食|ふしょく} (chemical corrosion)\n- {応力|おうりょく}{腐食|ふしょく} (stress corrosion)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {腐食|ふしょく}{防止|ぼうし} (corrosion prevention)\n- {腐食|ふしょく}{性|せい} (corrosive property)\n- {耐|たい}{腐食|ふしょく}{性|せい} (corrosion resistance)\n- {腐食|ふしょく}{剤|ざい} (corrosive agent)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {腐食|ふしょく}する (to corrode - suru verb)\n- {腐食|ふしょく}させる (to cause corrosion)\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {錆|さび} (rust)\n- {酸化|さんか} (oxidation)\n- {劣化|れっか} (deterioration)",
